<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ampolex gets A$5.5 mln from lawyers.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ampolex gets A$5.5 mln from lawyers.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampolex Ltd said it has recovered A$5.5 million from law firm Mallesons Stephen Jaques (Mallesons) over the A$17.9 million claim Ampolex lodged against Mallesons following a recent court settlement between Ampolex and Guinness Peat Group (GPG) Plc.</p>
</text>
